      facts: [{"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F001", "content": "try/except 用于捕获并处理运行时异常。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F001"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F002", "content": "异常处理可以避免程序因可预期错误直接终止。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F002"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F003", "content": "except 分支应针对具体错误给出处理逻辑。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F003"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F004", "content": "未捕获的异常会导致程序终止，并打印错误回溯信息。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F004"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F005", "content": "except 后可指定异常类型，如 ValueError、ZeroDivisionError。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F005"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F006", "content": "else 子句在 try 块未发生异常时执行。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F006"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F007", "content": "finally 子句无论是否异常都会执行，适合释放资源。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F007"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F008", "content": "raise 语句可主动抛出指定异常。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F008"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F009", "content": "一个 try 可搭配多个 except 分支处理不同异常。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F009"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F010", "content": "except Exception 可捕获大多数异常，但应避免过度使用。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F010"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F011", "content": "用 except ... as e 可获取异常对象并读取错误信息。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F011"}, {"sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F012", "content": "异常类型存在继承关系，如 FileNotFoundError 是 OSError 的子类。", "source_id": "K016", "fact_id": "F012"}],
      examples: [{"title": "处理数字转换异常", "code": "user_input = input(\"请输入成绩：\")\ntry:\n    score = int(user_input)\n    if score >= 60:\n        print(\"及格\")\n    else:\n        print(\"不及格\")\nexcept ValueError:\n    print(\"输入无效，请输入数字。\")", "explanation": "当用户输入非数字字符串时，int() 抛出 ValueError，被 except 捕获后给出友好提示。"}, {"title": "处理文件操作异常", "code": "filename = input(\"请输入文件名：\")\ntry:\n    with open(filename, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        print(f.read())\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    print(\"文件不存在，请检查文件名。\")\nexcept PermissionError:\n    print(\"没有权限读取该文件。\")", "explanation": "针对不同类型的异常分别处理，比捕获所有异常更精确。"}],
      practiceTasks: ["用 try/except 处理数字转换和除零错误", "写一个 safe_divide(a, b) 函数处理除零异常", "写代码捕获 int() 转换非数字输入时抛出的 ValueError"],
      quizItems: [{"level": 1, "type": "choice", "question": "如果 try 块中没有抛出异常，except 块会执行吗？", "answer": "不会", "sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F001", "options": ["会", "不会", "看情况", "报错"]}, {"level": 2, "type": "practice", "question": "写一个 safe_divide(a, b) 函数，返回 a/b 的结果，如果 b 为 0 则返回\"除数不能为0\"。", "answer": "能用 try/except 捕获 ZeroDivisionError。", "sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F002"}, {"level": 2, "type": "practice", "question": "用 try/except/finally 写代码：读取文件，无论是否成功最后都打印\"结束\"。", "answer": "能正确使用 finally 子句。", "sourceId": "K016", "factId": "F007"}],
